description: "One sentence: the claim this paper makes."
categories: [research]
bibliography: [references.bib]
---

State your claim in the first paragraph, then support it. Cite prior work with
`[@key]` syntax, which resolves against `references.bib` — for example the
literate-programming idea [@knuth1984literate].

Add sections with `##`, figures with `![caption](path){#fig-x}`, and refer to
them with `@fig-x`. The reference list renders under the heading below.

# References
